# VipGroup App — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values. Never commit `.env`.
# Every new variable must be added here with a comment explaining it.

# Folder holding the converted books (<dir>/<id>/manifest.json, …), read by the studio.
# Optional: defaults to <repo root>/storage/flipbooks. Set it when the studio is started
# from another folder (e.g. by pm2) or when the books live on another disk.
# FLIPBOOKS_DIR=/absolute/path/to/storage/flipbooks
